			"tags": [],
			"exportToToc": false,
			"allowOutOfBounds": true,
			"doc": "Starts a cutscene when a player body is inside the rectangle, in this level's room. `cutscene` is the id of a script in the cutscene library; the script must have a seen flag, so it plays once. `after_encounter`, when set, holds the scene until that encounter is cleared. A level's `entry_cutscene` starts a scene on arrival; this starts one HERE, where its people are.",
